# MLB Research Tab — Agent Memory (do not break)

Standalone hitter research tool at **`preview/research/`**, linked from the HR cheat sheet toolbar as **"MLB Research (BETA) →"**. Live URL: `https://worstpickz.win/research/index.html?date=YYYY-MM-DD`.

This is **separate from the cheat sheet** (`preview/index.html`) but shares theme (`worstpickz-theme` in localStorage), park-factor source (Ballpark Pal), and PropFinder CSVs in `data/`.

