## Architecture (data flow)

```
PropFinder CSVs (data/)          Ballpark Pal ParkFactors_YYYY-MM-DD.csv
        │                                      │
        ▼                                      ▼
fetch-research-slate.py ──► research/mlb_api.build_slate()
        │                         │
        │                    MLB Stats API (schedule, lineups, probables)
        │                         │
        ▼                         ▼
preview/data/research-YYYY-MM-DD.json    Savant CSVs (via py cache or Netlify fn)
preview/data/park-factors-YYYY-MM-DD.json
        │
        ▼
research.js loadSlate(date) ──► table + mobile cards + weather panel
```

**Browser cannot open `file://`** — `index.html` shows a blocking overlay. Always use `python serve-research.py` locally or the live Netlify site.

