## Slate date behavior

| Context | Default date |
|---------|--------------|
| **Research tab** (`research.js`) | **Today's local calendar date** (`todayLocalIso()`). URL `?date=` overrides. Commit: "Default MLB Research to today instead of cheat sheet slate date." |
| **Cheat sheet** | `meta name="sheet-date"` on `preview/index.html` |
| **Research link from sheet** | `research/index.html` with **no** `?date=` — user lands on today |

When shipping a new cheat sheet slate, `patch-*-preview.py` auto-runs `post_patch.sync_research_tab_after_patch()` — no separate `fetch-research-slate.py` step unless refreshing without patching. Manual refresh: `python fetch-research-slate.py --date YYYY-MM-DD`.

