## DO NOT regress (known fixed bugs)

| Bug | Fix location | Rule |
|-----|--------------|------|
| Wrong park % (stale/latest CSV) | `research/park_factors.py` | Only `ParkFactors_{slate_date}*.csv` |
| Attributed park to PropFinder | `research.js` weather UI | Label **Ballpark Pal** |
| `file://` blank/broken page | `index.html` overlay + `research.js` guard | Keep server requirement |
| `CLE @ CWS` vs `CLE @ CHW` park miss | `PARK_GAME_KEY_ALIASES` + `TITLE_WEATHER_KEY_ALIASES` | Keep aliases aligned |
| Research defaulted to cheat sheet date | `initResearchDate()` | Default **today**, not sheet meta |
| Auto-load latest ParkFactors | reverted in `park_factors.py` | **Never** reintroduce "pick newest CSV" |
| Help cursor on tooltips | `research.css` | `cursor: default` on tips, not `help` |
| K lines showed 0 (K% treated as K/9) | `seasonPitcherK9` in `research.js` | Keep K% → K/9 conversion (× 4.28 BF/IP × 9) and the "both k and ip present" start filter |
| Live-site 404 spam from dev-only proxies | `proxyAvailable()` in `research.js` | Gate `/api/player-trends`, `/api/pitcher-trends` behind the probe |
| XSS via player/team names in `innerHTML` | `escAttr()` / `escapeTip` in `research.js` | Escape all external strings in new render paths |
| Stale server on 8080 serving old code | `serve-research.py` exclusive bind + `/api/health` | Kill all `serve-research` procs, restart, verify `codeMtime` |

